# Automatic PR review — see docs/pr-review.md
# Scans open PRs across the reviewer agent's GitHub App installation and
# instructs it to review any the bot hasn't reviewed yet. The "needs review?"
# check is pure GitHub REST (no AI tokens); the agent is only woken when a PR
# actually needs review.
#
# No env vars required — the reviewer agent group is auto-discovered from
# whichever group has a GitHub App identity bound to it.
#
# Scheduling: add a system cron entry that invokes `ncl pr-review run`, e.g.
#   * * * * * /path/to/ncl pr-review run >/dev/null
#
# Optional overrides:
# PR_REVIEW_AGENT_GROUP_ID=<reviewer agent group id>   # when multiple GitHub Apps are configured
# PR_REVIEW_COOLDOWN_MS=1800000                         # re-dispatch cooldown if no review lands (min 60000)
# PR_REVIEW_STATUS_MESSAGING_GROUP_ID=<messaging_group id>  # chat to ping with status updates
